# The decoy workspace is written at runtime by ensureDecoys(). It is kept out of
# git deliberately: it contains a file named `secrets/id_rsa` and a `.env`, both
# obviously fake, and both exactly the kind of name a hosting provider's secret
# scanner stops a push on. Nothing is lost — the fixture creates the tree on first
# run, and a test asserts that it does.
fixture-home/
